# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Without this, a direct visit to /full returns a 404: Pages serves static
# files and there is no /full/index.html on disk — the route only exists
# once React boots and reads window.location.pathname. vercel.json has an
# equivalent rewrite but Cloudflare does not read it.
#
# 200 (not 301) so the browser keeps the original URL and the app can route on it.
/*    /index.html   200
